                            <comment id="16284224" author="gvvinblade" created="Fri, 8 Dec 2017 21:15:13 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=kirill.shirokov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;kirill.shirokov&quot;&gt;kirill.shirokov&lt;/a&gt;, returned from &lt;tt&gt;readLock(..)&lt;/tt&gt; zero doesn&apos;t mean that page is locked. This method will wait until whether write lock is freed or page is recycled, so that &lt;tt&gt;&amp;lt;locked&amp;gt;&lt;/tt&gt; output is incorrect. Such node must be just skipped.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
